{"ID":"20240206134952-uqcmbu8","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206134952-uqcmbu8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206134952-uqcmbu8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135002-3dst7h6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206134956-bj2i64c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135002-3dst7h6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:216,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:216\u0026#125;","title":"椿皮","type":"doc","updated":"20240206134956"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206135002-3dst7h6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135002-3dst7h6","updated":"20240206135008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产华北地区以及浙江等地。\n【性状】\t根皮呈扁平块片或不规则卷片状，长宽不一，厚25(10)mm，外表面灰黄色或黄棕色，粗糙，皮孔明显，纵向延长，微突起，有时外面栓皮剥落，呈淡黄白色；内表面淡黄色，较平坦，密布细小棱形小点或小孔。质坚脆，折断面强纤维性，易与外皮分离。微有油腥臭气，折断后更甚，味苦。\n干皮多呈扁平块状，厚3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5mm或更厚；外表面暗灰色至灰黑色，具不规则纵横裂，皮孔大，去栓皮后呈淡棕黄色；折断面颗粒性。\n【性味】\t苦、涩，寒。\n【功效】\t清热燥湿，收涩止带，止泻，止血。用于赤白带下，湿热泻痢，久泻久痢，便血，崩漏。\n【炙品】\t炒椿皮：先将麸皮撒入锅内加热，至烟起时，再将椿皮倒入拌炒至两面焦黄色，取出，筛去麸皮，放凉 (每100斤椿皮，用麸皮10斤) 。缓和药性。\n椿皮炭：取椿树皮丝，置锅内用武火炒至外黑色，内呈黑褐色为度，洒凉水适量，灭尽火量，取出，闷一夜。增强收涩止血功效。\n蜜椿皮：将蜂蜜置锅内，加热至沸倒入椿皮丝，用文火炒至黄色，不粘手为度，取出，放凉。每椿皮丝500g，用炼熟蜂蜜90g。矫正药材的苦涩之味。"}]},{"ID":"20240206134956-bj2i64c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206134956-bj2i64c","updated":"20240206134956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206134956-6p5zv3d.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902093807-mrqp7n7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093807-mrqp7n7","updated":"20240902093807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 581px;","style":"width: 571px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"臭椿树 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/臭椿树 12-20240715144129-a6kzg98.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 571px;\" parent-style=\"width: 581px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 612px;","style":"width: 602px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"臭椿树 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/臭椿树 3-20240715141829-ejlnjwp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 602px;\" parent-style=\"width: 612px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902093812-vwwnala","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093812-vwwnala","updated":"20240902093812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 801px;","style":"width: 791px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"臭椿树 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/臭椿树 4-20240715142151-uzxy022.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 791px;\" parent-style=\"width: 801px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 404px;","style":"width: 394px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"臭椿树 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/臭椿树 9-20240715143111-flkclrz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 394px;\" parent-style=\"width: 404px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715140856-qi9kqqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715140856-qi9kqqx","updated":"20240715141952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 443px;","style":"width: 433px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"臭椿树 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/臭椿树 1-20240715140856-wk40rhb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 433px;\" parent-style=\"width: 443px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 781px;","style":"width: 771px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"臭椿树 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/臭椿树 2-20240715141703-2au3lw6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 771px;\" parent-style=\"width: 781px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715142419-sggl4sq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715142419-sggl4sq","updated":"20240715143704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 642px;","style":"width: 632px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"臭椿树 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/臭椿树 10-20240715143201-z22sogp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 632px;\" parent-style=\"width: 642px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 573px;","style":"width: 563px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"臭椿树 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/臭椿树 5-20240715142323-zaqlpef.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 563px;\" parent-style=\"width: 573px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715143201-mgdp288","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715143201-mgdp288","updated":"20240715143705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 643px;","style":"width: 633px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"臭椿树 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/臭椿树 6-20240715142419-f850d3q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 633px;\" parent-style=\"width: 643px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 572px;","style":"width: 562px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"臭椿树 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/臭椿树 11-20240715143644-ct4q2e2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 562px;\" parent-style=\"width: 572px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715140743-vczs5vz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715140743-vczs5vz","updated":"20240715142026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 680px;","style":"width: 670px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240715142026-ttlmwgm.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 670px;\" parent-style=\"width: 680px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 518px;","style":"width: 508px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"臭椿树"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/臭椿树-20240715140743-f4fzxux.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 508px;\" parent-style=\"width: 518px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715140540-h4c2ec7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715140540-h4c2ec7","updated":"20240715144320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 642px;","style":"width: 632px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"臭椿树 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/臭椿树 13-20240715144320-1xej2hy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 632px;\" parent-style=\"width: 642px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 601px;","style":"width: 591px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"椿树 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/椿树 1-20240715140540-pvibtj2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 591px;\" parent-style=\"width: 601px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715142517-jm2u1e0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715142517-jm2u1e0","updated":"20240715142517"}},{"ID":"20240715142517-iay5cct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715142517-iay5cct","updated":"20240715142624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"臭椿和香椿对比（大概率，也有特例）"}]},{"ID":"20240715143016-5r0dked","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715143016-5r0dked","updated":"20240715143016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 502px;","style":"width: 492px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"臭椿树 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/臭椿树 8-20240715143016-dly4fsq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 492px;\" parent-style=\"width: 502px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715140621-pp3v8ub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715140621-pp3v8ub","updated":"20240715140710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：取图为臭椿树；"}]},{"ID":"20240715141011-ithutgb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715141011-ithutgb","updated":"20240715141027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：香椿树和臭椿树较为相似，以下为区分点"}]},{"ID":"20240715141141-lxxk94v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715141141-lxxk94v","updated":"20240715141555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"臭椿树茎杆、枝干相对更光滑；"}]},{"ID":"20240715141032-g0ye5ve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715141032-g0ye5ve","updated":"20240715141136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"臭椿树茎杆分枝较多，而香椿树一般是直立向上生长，在顶部再长分枝；"}]},{"ID":"20240715141152-wpbchk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715141152-wpbchk6","updated":"20240715141448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"臭椿叶子虽然双数对生的，但到最后枝叶末端就只有一片叶子，而香椿叶子是两片两片生长，到最后枝叶末端的叶片也是两片叶子。"}]},{"ID":"20240715142711-la7yrzz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715142711-la7yrzz","updated":"20240715142817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"香椿嫩叶偏红光滑，老叶子则变绿了，香椿叶子味道较香，而臭椿叶子毛茸茸有臭味；"}]},{"ID":"20240715140622-ri9d5lq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240715140622-ri9d5lq"}},{"ID":"20240902093729-lj9csly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093729-lj9csly","updated":"20240902093735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：大果臭椿皮"}]},{"ID":"20240902093729-63joqhz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093729-63joqhz","updated":"20240902093734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大果臭椿皮"}]},{"ID":"20240902093729-gdzpk97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093729-gdzpk97","updated":"20240902093734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】DàGuǒChòuChūnPí"}]},{"ID":"20240902093729-176f006","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093729-176f006","updated":"20240902093734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902093729-sviuloe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093729-sviuloe","updated":"20240902093734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为苦木科植物大果臭椿的根皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240902093729-dk861xv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093729-dk861xv","updated":"20240902093734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Ailanthusaltissima（Mill.）Swinglevar.sutchuenensis（Dode）Rehd.etWils.[A.sutchuenensisDode]"}]},{"ID":"20240902093729-87ktftl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093729-87ktftl","updated":"20240902093734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：春、夏季挖取根部，刮去粗皮，剥取根白皮，切丝，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902093729-lhx9ypk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093729-lhx9ypk","updated":"20240902093734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】大果臭椿落叶乔木，高10-30m。树皮灰色或淡褐色，幼枝无毛，红褐色，有光泽。奇数羽状复叶互生；小叶柄紫色，长5-10mm；叶片卵状披针形，通常较大，长9-14cm，宽1.5-7.5cm，先端短尖或渐尖，基部楔形至圆形，边缘无纤毛，近基部两侧有粗齿1-2对，每粗齿背面有1腺体。花小，杂性，白色带绿，排成多分枝的圆锥花序，长35-50cm；花瓣长约2.5cm，两面均被柔毛，雄花有雄蕊10，长于花瓣，花丝基部被粗毛；雌花中雄蕊短于花瓣，心皮5，花柱扭曲，粘合，柱头5裂。翅果长圆状椭圆形，长4.5-7cm，宽1.5-2cm，微带红褐色。种子1颗，位于翅果的近中部。花期6月，果期7-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902093729-0aquqra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093729-0aquqra","updated":"20240902093734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902093729-zepcxr2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093729-zepcxr2","updated":"20240902093734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于海拔1700-2500m的路旁、沟边杂木林或灌丛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240902093729-64ww7zh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093729-64ww7zh","updated":"20240902093734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于江西、湖北、湖南、四川、云南。"}]},{"ID":"20240902093729-mfu3kyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093729-mfu3kyy","updated":"20240902093734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】根皮含樗苦素(ailanthin)及皂甙(saponin)；木材含树脂(resin)，鞣质(tannin)，碳水化合物(carborhydrate)及香草醛(vanillin)等。"}]},{"ID":"20240902093729-8z4ekp4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093729-8z4ekp4","updated":"20240902093734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦；涩；凉"}]},{"ID":"20240902093729-9vo2exe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093729-9vo2exe","updated":"20240902093734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热燥湿；解毒杀虫。主痢疾；便血；崩漏；带下；疮痈"}]},{"ID":"20240902093729-zhk2x6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093729-zhk2x6a","updated":"20240902093734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，6-12g。外用：适量，煎水洗；或熬膏涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240902093729-5rbtxmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093729-5rbtxmm","updated":"20240902093734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902093730-x6twlwh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902093730-x6twlwh","updated":"20240902093734"}},{"ID":"20240902093731-15ly43i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093731-15ly43i","updated":"20240902093734"}}]}